OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBright spells and scattered
OL,6,Fshowers, these showers heaviest and
OL,7,Fmost frequent in the morning with a
OL,8,Fchance of thunder. Best of the
OL,9,Fbrightness in the southeast.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FClear spells and scattered
OL,12,Fshowers in the evening, a few of these
OL,13,Fheavy at first. Clear spells and
OL,14,Fshowers overnight, staying driest in
OL,15,Fthe southeast.
OL,16,
OL,17,CWednesday:FBright spells and a few
OL,18,Fshowers in the morning, these mainly
OL,19,Fover Antrim. Cloud spilling east in
OL,20,Fthe afternoon before occasionally
OL,21,Fheavy rain pushes east in the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
