OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FBright spells and scattered blustery
OL,7,Fshowers on Thursday. Showers easing
OL,8,Fearly Friday, becoming dry and bright
OL,9,Fbefore rain spreads east later. Bright
OL,10,Fspells and scattered showers on
OL,11,FSaturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
